IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-CLAWVM-ORACLE.

DATA DIVISION.
01 HORIZON-H           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 TRACE-TURNS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 BUDGET-TOKENS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 ORACLE-GAP          PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-CLAWVM-ORACLE.
    IF TRACE-TURNS == 0 OR BUDGET-TOKENS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 0 TO ORACLE-GAP.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 HORIZON-H.
    WEIGHT 30 ORACLE-GAP.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
